<section class="c-card c-card--hud p-editor__tool-panel">
    <div class="p-editor__panel-header">
        <span class="c-eyebrow">Layer Stack</span>
        <h2>Ordering</h2>
        <p>Reorder overlays with native controls. Selected layers also expose resize handles on the stage.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="c-layer-panel" data-layer-panel>
        <div class="c-empty-state c-empty-state--compact" data-layer-empty-state>
            <strong>No overlays yet</strong>
            <p>Add a sticker to unlock capture and layer controls.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="c-layer-panel__list" data-layer-list></ol>
    </div>
</section>
